---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description={`Privacy information for ${site.brand}.`}>
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p>This page explains, in general terms, how enquiry information is handled on this site.</p>
  <h2>What the enquiry form collects</h2>
  <p>
    The general enquiry form asks for your name, email address, area, service of interest, and a
    short description of what you have noticed. Nothing else is requested.
  </p>
  <h2>How it is used</h2>
  <p>
    Enquiry details are used only to respond to your enquiry and discuss scope. They are not
    sold, rented, or used for unrelated marketing lists.
  </p>
  <h2>Retention and questions</h2>
  <p>
    Enquiry records are kept only as long as needed to handle the enquiry. Questions about your
    information can be raised through the <a href={site.enquiryPath}>general enquiry page</a>.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
